# Generated at build time by scripts/writeFirebaseMessagingSw.mjs from the
# NUXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* variables. Committing it meant a local build without
# .env could overwrite it with empty strings and ship push that silently never
# fires. CI generates it, and refuses to build if the config is missing.
